## 2. Preset shots

Each preset is that one command with two speeds filled in.

| Preset        | Upper    | Lower    | Spin     |
| ------------- | -------- | -------- | -------- |
| Neutral shot  | 3000 RPM | 3000 RPM | none     |
| Backspin shot | 2500 RPM | 3500 RPM | backspin |
| Topspin shot  | 3500 RPM | 2500 RPM | topspin  |
| Stop          | 0 RPM    | 0 RPM    |          |

