| Feature                                                                  | TalonFX                   | TalonFXS                  | SparkMax/Flex                                                                                                    | Nova                                                                       |
| ------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------- | ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| PID Controller                                                           | ✅                         | ✅                         | ✅                                                                                                                | ⚠️ (SystemCore)                                                            |
| [LQR Controller](/documentation/understanding/editor/lqr-controllers.md) | ⚠️ (SystemCore)           | ⚠️ (SystemCore)           | ⚠️ (SystemCore)                                                                                                  | ⚠️ (SystemCore)                                                            |
